title: "The Thiele Machine: A Computational Model with Explicit Structural Cost"
authors:
  - family-names: Thiele
    given-names: Devon
type: software
version: 4.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-04
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/sethirus/The-Thiele-Machine"
url: "https://github.com/sethirus/The-Thiele-Machine"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.17316437
keywords:
  - models of computation
  - abstract machine model
  - observation and information loss
  - structural cost
  - No Free Insight
  - formal verification
